WEBVTT

01:31.934 --> 01:37.252
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.252 --> 01:40.519
[Episode 23]

01:40.519 --> 01:41.760
Yunniang found out

01:41.760 --> 01:43.120
the County Princess was behind it.

01:43.120 --> 01:45.439
So, I know it's not easy to save you.

01:46.239 --> 01:47.799
My teacher wrote to me,

01:47.799 --> 01:49.200
telling me to hurry back.

01:49.200 --> 01:51.480
He says if I fail to save you,

01:51.480 --> 01:52.719
I won't need to go back to see him.

01:54.920 --> 01:55.920
Please thank Master Xu

01:55.920 --> 01:57.128
and Yunniang for me.

01:59.000 --> 02:00.959
I came all this way to save you.

02:00.959 --> 02:02.000
Aren't you going to thank me?

02:06.719 --> 02:07.912
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

02:10.199 --> 02:11.439
So,

02:11.439 --> 02:12.439
I didn't come in vain.

02:14.039 --> 02:15.144
Leave me here.

02:15.719 --> 02:16.968
I'm leaving.

02:18.039 --> 02:19.560
Mr. Jiang.

02:22.560 --> 02:24.159
I have a request.

02:26.800 --> 02:29.639
Could you possibly buy me?

02:31.120 --> 02:33.280
Otherwise, as an official servant,

02:33.960 --> 02:35.199
I can never leave here.

02:37.080 --> 02:38.719
I want to continue doing business.

02:38.719 --> 02:42.120
- I want to--
- You want me to get you

02:42.120 --> 02:44.319
out of trouble
so that you can return to Chang'an.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.800
I heard

02:47.800 --> 02:49.199
that your shop has already…

02:52.199 --> 02:53.960
Yes, I've lost my shop.

02:53.960 --> 02:55.080
I've lost everything.

02:55.080 --> 02:56.240
Mr. Jiang.

02:56.240 --> 02:57.639
You know it.

02:57.639 --> 02:59.719
I have business acumen.

03:00.479 --> 03:01.520
If you

03:01.520 --> 03:03.120
help me leave this place,

03:03.120 --> 03:04.400
I will surely rise again.

03:05.039 --> 03:06.599
Anyway, I can be

03:06.599 --> 03:07.840
a big money maker.

03:11.800 --> 03:13.199
If you agree,

03:14.719 --> 03:15.800
we can discuss the ratio

03:15.800 --> 03:17.439
of profit sharing.

03:17.439 --> 03:19.199
I can give you an additional 20 percent.

03:36.489 --> 03:38.120
[Buyer: Jiang Changyang]

03:45.439 --> 03:46.919
You've already bought me.

03:48.840 --> 03:49.840
So,

03:50.520 --> 03:52.639
just to gain more benefits from me,

03:52.639 --> 03:54.599
you didn't let me know?

03:54.599 --> 03:56.199
I didn't mean it.

03:56.960 --> 03:58.840
You mentioned profit sharing,

03:58.840 --> 04:00.199
didn't you?

04:01.759 --> 04:03.599
You can pay back the money

04:03.599 --> 04:05.000
for buying you monthly.

04:07.680 --> 04:09.319
You're cunning.

04:09.840 --> 04:11.080
You can't suffer any losses.

04:12.159 --> 04:13.879
That's why I can be your master.

04:14.719 --> 04:15.879
Don't worry.

04:15.879 --> 04:17.120
I never beat or scold my maids.

04:18.319 --> 04:20.439
From now on, the money you earn is mine.

04:21.319 --> 04:22.319
But your life

04:23.160 --> 04:25.000
is still in your own hands.

04:26.759 --> 04:27.976
I'm leaving.

04:36.040 --> 04:37.720
What are you waiting for?

04:37.720 --> 04:38.920
Waiting for me to get you on?

04:46.216 --> 04:48.162
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

04:48.846 --> 04:51.480
♫ Congealing so much of the past ♫

04:51.480 --> 04:52.839
Hold on tight.

04:52.839 --> 04:54.839
If you fall, I won't take responsibility.

04:56.879 --> 04:58.056
Go home.

04:59.048 --> 05:00.904
♫ If love is like frost ♫

05:01.448 --> 05:05.812
♫ Can this ten thousand miles
of roaming winds and waves ♫

05:05.812 --> 05:07.368
♫ Can it ♫

05:09.199 --> 05:10.399
Fu.

05:10.399 --> 05:11.600
Your leg injury hasn't healed.

05:11.600 --> 05:13.279
You can't go to the barracks.

05:13.279 --> 05:14.319
Yes, Fu.

05:14.319 --> 05:15.480
Take care of your leg.

05:15.480 --> 05:17.480
I have no choice.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.600
Mr. Jiang has yet to return.

05:18.600 --> 05:19.879
We've done what we can.

05:19.879 --> 05:21.319
How can I save Mudan if I don't try it?

05:22.240 --> 05:23.480
We don't know if she's dead or alive.

05:23.480 --> 05:24.879
Are we going to sit here and do nothing?

05:27.000 --> 05:28.439
I will go with you.

05:28.439 --> 05:30.000
We'll wait at the entrance of the barracks.

05:30.000 --> 05:31.319
Someone will eventually come out

05:31.319 --> 05:32.639
to buy supplies or do things.

05:32.639 --> 05:35.079
I believe that we can ask for news about Mudan.

05:35.079 --> 05:36.488
Fine.

05:37.920 --> 05:39.680
But I can't leave my home.

05:39.680 --> 05:41.839
If my father finds out,

05:41.839 --> 05:43.240
I'm afraid I can't get out again.

05:43.920 --> 05:46.000
I'll prepare plenty of medicines and tonics.

05:46.000 --> 05:47.519
Just in case they can be delivered to Mudan.

05:48.480 --> 05:50.000
There should be someone guarding the house.

05:50.720 --> 05:51.959
Chun.

05:51.959 --> 05:54.120
Don't let Wang Qing take Mudan's flowers again.

05:55.360 --> 05:56.424
- Let's go.
- Go.

05:59.920 --> 06:01.199
- Who's there?
- Go have a look.

06:07.199 --> 06:08.759
- Mudan!
- Mudan!

06:11.000 --> 06:12.232
I'm back.

06:12.800 --> 06:14.319
How did you get out of the barracks?

06:15.920 --> 06:17.000
Well…

06:20.279 --> 06:22.000
It was Mr. Jiang.

06:22.000 --> 06:23.439
Mr. Jiang saved me.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.759
I'm sorry, Mudan.

06:28.279 --> 06:29.959
I failed to protect Huamanzhu for you.

06:30.639 --> 06:31.639
All of our money

06:32.160 --> 06:33.560
has been confiscated.

06:35.800 --> 06:37.120
It's okay.

06:37.120 --> 06:38.399
No big deal.

06:38.399 --> 06:40.639
Anyway, I can open a shop again.

06:43.240 --> 06:44.296
Wait.

06:44.296 --> 06:45.832
Let's go.

06:48.079 --> 06:49.360
What happened to Fu's leg?

06:50.600 --> 06:52.040
When fighting with Wang Qing,

06:52.040 --> 06:53.279
she got injured.

06:53.279 --> 06:54.399
Don't worry about it.

06:54.399 --> 06:55.959
Chun has already bandaged it.

06:58.079 --> 06:59.600
I got you all into trouble.

07:00.199 --> 07:01.600
Did the officials give you a hard time?

07:02.680 --> 07:03.920
Mudan.

07:03.920 --> 07:05.319
We are family.

07:05.319 --> 07:07.040
Don't blame yourself.

07:08.959 --> 07:10.120
Mudan.

07:10.920 --> 07:12.600
Thanks to your benevolence

07:13.680 --> 07:14.759
and far-sighted planning.

07:15.360 --> 07:17.839
When I joined the incense powder business,

07:17.839 --> 07:19.680
you advised me and Fu

07:19.680 --> 07:21.879
to open individual accounts.

07:21.879 --> 07:23.000
Well,

07:23.000 --> 07:25.279
your property has been confiscated,

07:25.279 --> 07:26.560
but mine and Fu's are safe.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.600
We can make a comeback.

07:29.120 --> 07:30.720
Let's put it aside for now.

07:30.720 --> 07:32.199
You and Fu are both injured.

07:32.199 --> 07:33.720
You stay home for a week.

07:33.720 --> 07:35.319
You both need time to recover.

07:36.879 --> 07:39.319
Don't be so serious. I'm good.

07:39.319 --> 07:40.328
Mudan.

07:41.240 --> 07:43.560
Fu, be careful.

07:43.560 --> 07:45.120
I know these things

07:45.120 --> 07:47.120
are very important to you.

07:47.120 --> 07:48.480
I hid them

07:49.000 --> 07:50.199
before the officials arrived.

08:05.560 --> 08:06.680
Thank you.

08:07.279 --> 08:08.399
Don't mention it.

08:08.399 --> 08:09.608
Everything will be fine.

08:10.199 --> 08:12.040
You're severely injured.

08:13.079 --> 08:16.160
W-Why am I crying?

08:18.759 --> 08:19.759
I'm fine.

08:20.480 --> 08:21.768
It's all right now.

08:22.600 --> 08:25.240
Alright, let me check your body in the room

08:25.240 --> 08:26.639
and see if you have more injuries.

08:27.319 --> 08:28.392
Let's go.

08:34.919 --> 08:36.360
What a ruthless person.

08:36.360 --> 08:37.679
As bad as this fruit.

08:37.679 --> 08:38.920
A rotten, sneaky person.

08:39.639 --> 08:40.879
Mudan.

08:40.879 --> 08:42.039
Don't be sad for such a person.

08:42.039 --> 08:43.112
It's not worth it.

08:47.240 --> 08:48.328
Be careful.

09:03.799 --> 09:05.639
The Herbaceous Peony's blooming season is over.

09:06.519 --> 09:07.960
It is now the season for summer flowers.

09:09.399 --> 09:10.440
You're skillful.

09:11.120 --> 09:12.399
Follow me to the Huamanzhu

09:12.399 --> 09:14.000
to take care of the flowers.

09:15.879 --> 09:17.720
I also need you

09:17.720 --> 09:18.879
to make the incense powder.

09:18.879 --> 09:20.120
So, can you--

09:20.120 --> 09:21.240
I have told you.

09:22.200 --> 09:23.480
I will never help you.

09:24.639 --> 09:26.399
Nor will I manage the shop.

09:29.759 --> 09:31.240
If you don't want to,

09:31.240 --> 09:32.639
let's go to Madam He's home

09:32.639 --> 09:35.000
to bring back her precious flowers.

09:36.120 --> 09:37.399
We should keep them.

09:37.919 --> 09:39.272
It's reassuring.

09:40.240 --> 09:42.279
Fu is guarding Mudan's home.

09:43.159 --> 09:45.720
Even if you can snatch those flowers,

09:45.720 --> 09:46.952
you won't take care of them well.

09:47.720 --> 09:49.240
Don't waste your time.

09:59.720 --> 10:02.440
Madam He is just an outsider.

10:03.080 --> 10:05.120
I'm your husband.

10:06.200 --> 10:09.120
Booming business makes our life better.

10:10.399 --> 10:12.120
Don't be angry anymore.

10:12.120 --> 10:13.159
Well,

10:13.159 --> 10:15.799
think about our future children.

10:16.440 --> 10:17.672
Please.

10:27.879 --> 10:29.120
Dear God,

10:30.279 --> 10:31.879
if you truly exist,

10:33.559 --> 10:35.080
I hope you protect Mudan

10:35.759 --> 10:36.919
and make her return safely.

11:20.480 --> 11:22.240
I'm as guilty as sin.

11:23.200 --> 11:25.519
Even the gods don't forgive me.

11:37.600 --> 11:38.720
A candle in the wind

11:39.480 --> 11:41.559
requires two persons to light it.

11:43.679 --> 11:44.936
With one person left,

11:45.720 --> 11:47.336
it will go out.

11:48.679 --> 11:49.928
Mudan.

11:51.639 --> 11:53.096
You're back.

11:54.279 --> 11:55.799
I didn't see you at the tavern.

11:56.720 --> 11:58.240
I guessed you might be here.

12:03.679 --> 12:05.159
You have had rough days.

12:07.799 --> 12:08.840
In that case,

12:10.039 --> 12:11.399
why did you betray me?

12:12.639 --> 12:13.840
Why did you stubbornly

12:13.840 --> 12:15.080
choose to do it?

12:16.159 --> 12:18.440
I have never thought of betraying you.

12:18.440 --> 12:19.519
The person I least want

12:19.519 --> 12:21.039
to hurt is you.

12:23.879 --> 12:25.799
All I want is to have a home.

12:26.879 --> 12:28.559
I didn't know Wang Qing would trap me

12:28.559 --> 12:30.120
to accuse you.

12:32.720 --> 12:33.879
Anyway, it's too late

12:34.879 --> 12:36.000
to explain.

12:37.159 --> 12:38.440
I have hurt you.

12:41.080 --> 12:43.279
If you wanted to reconcile with Wang Qing,

12:44.240 --> 12:46.080
why did you not tell me in advance?

12:47.080 --> 12:48.879
Am I not worthy of your trust?

12:49.600 --> 12:51.200
Have you forgotten

12:51.200 --> 12:52.799
how Wang Qing hurt you?

12:54.960 --> 12:55.960
He beat his former wife.

12:55.960 --> 12:57.039
His sweet nothings

12:57.039 --> 12:58.320
are like this candlelight.

12:59.000 --> 13:00.000
It seems warm.

13:00.720 --> 13:02.559
But it's not solid.

13:02.559 --> 13:03.799
A gust of wind can put it out.

13:11.799 --> 13:12.960
You have Chun

13:13.600 --> 13:14.720
and Fu.

13:16.320 --> 13:18.799
Mr. Jiang and your ex-husband pursue you.

13:20.320 --> 13:23.120
But I have nothing.

13:26.519 --> 13:28.639
I don't have a good family like Chun.

13:30.320 --> 13:31.320
I can't make you laugh

13:31.320 --> 13:32.480
like Fu.

13:34.799 --> 13:36.799
I can't make you proud of me.

13:38.200 --> 13:40.000
As Huamanzhu grows,

13:40.600 --> 13:42.639
more capable people will be around you.

13:45.600 --> 13:46.639
One day,

13:50.519 --> 13:52.080
you will not need me anymore.

13:56.639 --> 13:58.056
Shengyi.

13:59.440 --> 14:01.000
We are friends in trouble.

14:02.799 --> 14:04.559
When I had nothing,

14:05.600 --> 14:07.080
It was you who stayed with me.

14:07.639 --> 14:09.840
We started in this temple.

14:11.440 --> 14:12.879
Nobody can replace my friendship

14:12.879 --> 14:14.240
with you.

14:16.000 --> 14:17.679
Fu and Chun are my friends.

14:18.519 --> 14:20.279
But they're also your friend.

14:21.039 --> 14:22.440
Shouldn't we help each other

14:22.440 --> 14:23.919
and be considerate?

14:26.840 --> 14:27.880
Now,

14:29.320 --> 14:30.559
I've been reduced to a lowly status.

14:32.960 --> 14:34.399
And you've had tough days again.

14:36.759 --> 14:37.960
Shengyi.

14:39.080 --> 14:41.679
Don't you think it's too costly

14:43.559 --> 14:44.879
to see the truth?

15:06.159 --> 15:07.519
I'm sorry.

15:08.039 --> 15:09.080
Mudan.

15:09.840 --> 15:11.759
I'm so sorry.

15:13.840 --> 15:16.279
Whatever I do,

15:16.279 --> 15:18.559
I can't repay you in the slightest.

15:28.960 --> 15:30.600
Now seeing you well,

15:31.240 --> 15:32.840
I am very content.

15:33.960 --> 15:36.000
I won't appear before you again

15:36.000 --> 15:37.360
to make you sad.

15:40.000 --> 15:41.600
I just said so much

15:42.159 --> 15:43.720
not to make you sad.

15:45.159 --> 15:47.360
I wanted you to face reality.

15:48.279 --> 15:49.919
Don't make the same mistake again.

15:56.879 --> 15:58.088
Shengyi.

16:00.320 --> 16:01.600
If you're not living well,

16:03.759 --> 16:04.840
then come back.

16:15.200 --> 16:16.328
I have told you.

16:17.919 --> 16:19.799
I share the money I earn

16:20.480 --> 16:21.679
in Chang'an with you.

16:23.240 --> 16:25.000
I share my house

16:25.000 --> 16:26.559
with you.

16:27.960 --> 16:29.080
I didn't change my mind before.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.480
I don't today.

16:33.519 --> 16:34.559
I won't in the future.

16:40.679 --> 16:42.759
I can never become Qin Shengyi.

16:44.480 --> 16:46.440
I am still Qin Wuniang.

16:54.399 --> 16:55.559
I can't go back anymore.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.720
Why can't you go back?

17:05.319 --> 17:07.000
I'll eventually get Huamanzhu back.

17:07.559 --> 17:09.160
In my heart,

17:09.160 --> 17:10.839
you will always be Shengyi.

17:20.752 --> 17:23.135
[Sheng]

17:23.135 --> 17:25.341
[Yi]

17:50.480 --> 17:52.079
I won't come here again.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.272
Mudan.

17:56.759 --> 17:58.359
May all whom you meet

17:59.680 --> 18:01.440
be loyal friends.

18:02.839 --> 18:04.200
Never meet someone

18:05.839 --> 18:06.920
like me.

18:51.440 --> 18:52.880
What are you doing?

18:52.880 --> 18:54.079
Who?

18:54.079 --> 18:55.279
Who sent you here?

18:56.599 --> 18:57.720
Lady He.

18:57.720 --> 18:59.119
Mr. Jiang has brought the items

18:59.119 --> 19:01.079
from your hometown.

19:06.000 --> 19:07.160
You actually

19:07.160 --> 19:08.480
brought them all back to me.

19:33.920 --> 19:35.240
Is there something wrong?

19:39.319 --> 19:40.680
This was for Shengyi.

19:41.599 --> 19:42.839
I thought

19:42.839 --> 19:44.680
when she got married,

19:44.680 --> 19:47.640
I'd give this to her as her dowry.

19:50.839 --> 19:52.079
You've done what you can.

19:52.920 --> 19:54.359
She refused to come back.

19:56.680 --> 19:58.279
You're a carefree person.

19:58.279 --> 20:00.000
Why are you

20:00.000 --> 20:01.200
getting upset for nothing?

20:03.160 --> 20:04.519
Outside the barracks,

20:04.519 --> 20:05.720
who earnestly promised me

20:05.720 --> 20:07.759
to make a comeback?

20:09.079 --> 20:11.720
Sentimentality can't help you earn money.

20:13.079 --> 20:14.119
Don't worry.

20:14.839 --> 20:16.799
I'll reclaim Huamanzhu as quickly as possible

20:16.799 --> 20:18.200
and bring you profits.

20:19.279 --> 20:20.720
How much did these things cost?

20:21.359 --> 20:23.440
I'll pay back the money for these things

20:23.440 --> 20:24.680
and the money

20:24.680 --> 20:25.759
you bought me

20:25.759 --> 20:27.559
once I earn the money.

20:28.960 --> 20:30.799
I can't remember all these things.

20:33.039 --> 20:34.839
Count them later.

20:34.839 --> 20:36.319
Report the amount to her tomorrow.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.056
Yes.

20:45.960 --> 20:47.720
- Try this candied fruit.
- These Hu cakes should be eaten soon.

20:56.519 --> 20:57.599
Did you go to the Zhang's Starched Noodles

20:57.599 --> 20:58.720
I recommended?

21:00.000 --> 21:02.240
Sure, but I didn't eat.

21:03.279 --> 21:04.920
Why not?

21:04.920 --> 21:06.359
Too many diners.

21:06.920 --> 21:08.960
There was only one bowl of noodles left
when I got there.

21:09.640 --> 21:11.079
I happened to come across an old man.

21:11.640 --> 21:12.880
He wanted to buy noodles

21:12.880 --> 21:14.440
for his daughter who fell off a cliff.

21:15.759 --> 21:17.400
As a good person,

21:17.400 --> 21:18.680
I gave the noodles to him.

21:19.720 --> 21:21.680
That old man misses his daughter.

21:22.359 --> 21:23.519
I gave up the noodles.

21:23.519 --> 21:25.880
So, he gave me some Hu cakes.

21:30.359 --> 21:32.400
The heat is okay.

21:32.400 --> 21:34.279
Give me the Hu cake. It's ready to bake.

21:44.359 --> 21:45.640
Have a try.

21:45.640 --> 21:46.920
Does it have a taste of home?

22:11.279 --> 22:12.359
Is that man

22:14.240 --> 22:15.720
in good health?

22:17.039 --> 22:18.039
He's all well.

22:19.799 --> 22:20.839
However,

22:21.960 --> 22:23.319
he misses his daughter very much.

22:25.880 --> 22:27.176
He fears

22:28.000 --> 22:29.799
that she's a lonely soul
with no one to care for.

22:49.440 --> 22:50.824
That's good.

22:59.839 --> 23:01.359
A traveler is tired of seeking fame

23:01.960 --> 23:03.240
and returns home when spring comes.

23:06.079 --> 23:07.240
You've already been

23:07.240 --> 23:08.359
back to He Weifang,

23:09.160 --> 23:10.536
Go back home

23:11.519 --> 23:12.519
if you're homesick.

23:23.880 --> 23:24.920
You once asked me

23:27.000 --> 23:28.480
why I didn't go back to my family

23:28.480 --> 23:30.000
after leaving the Liu family.

23:33.720 --> 23:35.039
Actually, I did go back then.

23:38.799 --> 23:40.319
I returned by carriage.

23:43.559 --> 23:45.039
When I was nearly home,

23:46.160 --> 23:48.359
I saw the candlelight in my home.

23:50.200 --> 23:54.680
I thought the candles were lit for my return.

23:57.319 --> 23:59.400
But when I got closer, I saw my father standing

24:00.920 --> 24:03.240
with the Liu family's servants.

24:04.240 --> 24:05.359
They were about to search for me.

24:09.000 --> 24:10.599
I heard my father say

24:12.200 --> 24:14.079
that the Liu family was good

24:16.079 --> 24:20.039
and a woman must get married.

24:21.519 --> 24:22.680
If they found me,

24:23.880 --> 24:25.400
they would send me back to the Liu family.

24:28.319 --> 24:29.559
At that moment,

24:33.000 --> 24:34.248
I realized

24:35.720 --> 24:36.839
I could never return home again.

24:42.680 --> 24:43.920
Parents love their children

24:44.960 --> 24:46.119
and plan for them.

24:48.000 --> 24:49.680
But sometimes, their plans

24:50.880 --> 24:52.359
are not what the children desire.

24:55.599 --> 24:57.480
The County Princess is loved by Prince Ning.

24:58.240 --> 24:59.440
Yet she has to marry someone

24:59.440 --> 25:00.759
she does not love.

25:02.400 --> 25:04.440
My father loves me.

25:06.519 --> 25:07.640
But he believes

25:09.000 --> 25:10.279
the wisest choice for me is

25:10.279 --> 25:11.880
to get married

25:11.880 --> 25:13.240
and have my children.

25:14.880 --> 25:15.880
He doesn't understand.

25:17.680 --> 25:20.559
I don't want to be a paper kite
that is controlled by others.

25:24.160 --> 25:25.400
I want to be a free-flying bird.

25:33.319 --> 25:35.640
Moreover, he has a concubine

25:35.640 --> 25:37.079
and Man'er.

25:37.079 --> 25:38.839
He has to support a whole family.

25:39.920 --> 25:41.240
Even if I go back home,

25:41.240 --> 25:43.279
it will only bother them.

25:46.160 --> 25:47.432
In that case,

25:48.759 --> 25:50.056
it's better not to go back.

25:51.279 --> 25:53.119
Anyway, I know he's living well.

26:01.319 --> 26:02.504
Jiang Changyang.

26:04.759 --> 26:06.240
Thank you for bringing this to me.

26:09.680 --> 26:11.640
Chuanyu wanted to have noodles.

26:11.640 --> 26:13.759
It's not a problem for me.

26:16.039 --> 26:18.640
You've pretended to be a bad guy for too long.

26:19.160 --> 26:20.680
Have you already forgotten

26:20.680 --> 26:22.160
how to be a good person?

26:23.319 --> 26:25.160
You helped me.

26:25.160 --> 26:26.279
Yet you denied it.

26:33.400 --> 26:35.279
I was wrong about you before.

26:36.519 --> 26:38.839
In fact, even today, I don't know

26:39.759 --> 26:41.279
what kind of person you are.

26:42.599 --> 26:44.200
But I know

26:44.200 --> 26:46.000
you are a good gentleman.

26:47.920 --> 26:49.200
Whether I am an official's family member

26:49.880 --> 26:52.039
a flower merchant, or an official servant,

26:53.440 --> 26:56.039
you have never looked down on me.

26:57.960 --> 26:59.176
Jiang Changyang.

27:00.279 --> 27:02.359
You're my creditor.

27:02.359 --> 27:07.000
♫ Can this ten thousand miles
of roaming winds and waves ♫

27:07.000 --> 27:08.519
Other than that, can we

27:08.519 --> 27:12.279
♫ Finally touch a sunny day ♫

27:12.279 --> 27:13.720
become good friends?

27:17.192 --> 27:20.799
♫ Clouds are hidden by night ♫

27:20.799 --> 27:21.920
Are you drunk?

27:21.920 --> 27:24.759
♫ Fleecy clouds in the sky ♫

27:24.759 --> 27:26.279
Sure, I'm drunk.

27:27.039 --> 27:28.799
That's why I had the courage to say this.

27:29.832 --> 27:34.160
♫ The moon falls on my shoulder,
a path of dim yellow ♫

27:34.160 --> 27:35.464
Well,

27:39.319 --> 27:40.319
we've long been friends.

27:41.320 --> 27:43.720
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

27:43.720 --> 27:47.471
♫ What's the harm in a life of solitude ♫

27:47.471 --> 27:49.863
♫ Yet you shine as light ♫

27:49.863 --> 27:53.768
♫ Piercing through my heart ♫

27:53.768 --> 27:56.305
♫ If love is like frost ♫

27:56.305 --> 28:00.808
♫ There's a flickering candle ♫

28:00.808 --> 28:02.350
♫ No words are said ♫

28:02.350 --> 28:04.712
♫ Yet for you ♫

28:04.712 --> 28:07.880
♫ I'll go ahead ♫

28:10.599 --> 28:11.752
My lord.

28:12.759 --> 28:13.920
Any news?

28:22.400 --> 28:23.720
She would rather be an official servant

28:23.720 --> 28:24.839
than marry me?

28:26.759 --> 28:28.279
That's impossible.

28:28.279 --> 28:29.759
I will ask her personally.

28:29.759 --> 28:31.480
My lord.

28:31.480 --> 28:33.200
She has already left the barracks.

28:39.720 --> 28:41.640
Previously, you couldn't

28:41.640 --> 28:42.720
select a good horse.

28:43.519 --> 28:45.079
Today, a good horse has arrived.

28:45.079 --> 28:46.680
Mr. Jiang, see if you like it.

28:48.240 --> 28:49.640
Thank you, Zishu.

28:49.640 --> 28:51.079
You don't have to

28:51.079 --> 28:52.519
deliver a horse personally.

28:53.160 --> 28:54.920
I think you know

28:54.920 --> 28:56.240
what I'm here for.

29:01.319 --> 29:02.632
Get on the horse.

29:03.960 --> 29:05.400
Take this horse for a walk.

29:06.759 --> 29:07.912
Yes.

29:20.440 --> 29:22.640
You failed to manage your family,

29:22.640 --> 29:25.079
causing me to lose Huamanzhu, a money spinner.

29:25.759 --> 29:27.240
Are you here for my compensation?

29:27.759 --> 29:29.839
I can give however much you want

29:31.480 --> 29:32.720
as long as you

29:32.720 --> 29:34.279
sell He Weifang to me.

29:37.119 --> 29:39.039
He Weifang is a human, not a horse

29:39.039 --> 29:40.680
in the Stables Bureau.

29:40.680 --> 29:42.359
I can't sell a human

29:42.359 --> 29:43.839
to you.

29:43.839 --> 29:45.359
That's not what I meant.

29:45.359 --> 29:46.480
If you respect her,

29:47.039 --> 29:48.720
you should ask her if she wants to go with you.

29:49.640 --> 29:51.160
Or,

29:51.160 --> 29:52.720
you know

29:53.440 --> 29:54.799
that she will refuse you?

29:56.799 --> 29:58.720
Why are you so certain

29:58.720 --> 30:00.279
of what she is thinking?

30:02.039 --> 30:03.319
We live side by side,

30:03.319 --> 30:04.759
facing each other night after night.

30:04.759 --> 30:05.839
What do you think?

30:05.839 --> 30:07.640
Jiang Changyang.

30:07.640 --> 30:10.440
Back in Luoyang,
did you have a thing for my wife?

30:12.039 --> 30:14.240
You can have any woman if you like.

30:14.240 --> 30:15.599
Why steal the woman I love?

30:16.319 --> 30:18.319
It's not your place to judge me.

30:19.119 --> 30:20.400
Moreover,

30:20.400 --> 30:21.480
He Weifang

30:21.480 --> 30:23.279
doesn't love you.

30:23.279 --> 30:24.960
You're being narcissistic.

30:27.000 --> 30:28.519
How proud He Weifang is.

30:29.240 --> 30:30.319
If she has a choice,

30:31.400 --> 30:33.119
she won't willingly be a maid.

30:35.240 --> 30:36.799
Did you intercept the letter

30:36.799 --> 30:38.279
I sent to the barracks?

30:39.200 --> 30:40.759
I didn't see it.

30:41.400 --> 30:42.440
When I arrived at the barracks,

30:43.000 --> 30:44.160
she was nearly ravaged

30:44.160 --> 30:46.079
and killed by those soldiers.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.799
Liu Chang.

30:48.799 --> 30:50.559
You don't need me to tell you

30:51.720 --> 30:53.079
who ordered those soldiers, do you?

30:56.880 --> 30:58.039
You never

30:58.720 --> 31:00.008
understand He Weifang,

31:02.599 --> 31:03.960
the County Princess,

31:05.400 --> 31:07.079
and yourself.

31:13.640 --> 31:15.039
Return the horse to Mr. Liu.

31:15.720 --> 31:16.936
Let's go.

31:17.720 --> 31:18.824
Yes.

31:32.759 --> 31:34.759
You've been punished for what you did.

31:34.759 --> 31:35.839
You don't have to give me this.

31:37.039 --> 31:39.160
As long as you remain honest and upright,

31:39.160 --> 31:41.359
there will still be a place
for you in the guild.

31:42.680 --> 31:44.119
Thanks for your tolerance.

31:44.119 --> 31:45.240
I'm very thankful.

31:46.279 --> 31:48.559
However, I suddenly lost my position

31:48.559 --> 31:50.000
as deputy head.

31:50.000 --> 31:51.640
People gossip about me.

31:52.559 --> 31:53.720
Mr. Lv.

31:53.720 --> 31:55.440
Considering our old friendship,

31:55.440 --> 31:57.279
can you be more merciful to me?

31:57.279 --> 31:58.519
If possible,

31:58.519 --> 31:59.880
give me another chance.

32:01.200 --> 32:02.839
You have done something wrong.

32:03.440 --> 32:06.000
There's no reason to change your punishment.

32:06.000 --> 32:07.599
Do not mention it again.

32:08.920 --> 32:09.960
Yes.

32:13.960 --> 32:15.119
Madame Tang

32:15.119 --> 32:16.440
will celebrate her 80th birthday.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.440
Has anyone taken on her floral banquet?

32:19.039 --> 32:20.440
Madame Tang

32:20.960 --> 32:22.119
is fastidious.

32:22.119 --> 32:23.839
She has a title.

32:23.839 --> 32:25.319
Her words can crush a person.

32:26.079 --> 32:28.119
Nobody dares to take her order?

32:29.240 --> 32:30.559
As far as I know,

32:30.559 --> 32:32.480
the newly appointed deputy head

32:32.480 --> 32:34.480
does not have orders from nobles.

32:34.480 --> 32:36.720
Why not let him do this job?

32:37.759 --> 32:40.160
Aside from Madame Tang,

32:40.160 --> 32:42.319
Tang Silang is a notorious man.

32:42.839 --> 32:44.839
When his father's birthday banquet
was not well prepared,

32:44.839 --> 32:46.240
he destroyed the restaurant responsible

32:46.240 --> 32:47.240
for the banquet.

32:47.839 --> 32:49.200
Yuying.

32:49.200 --> 32:50.920
What are you up to?

32:51.559 --> 32:52.759
You got the wrong idea.

32:52.759 --> 32:54.440
I am just concerned for the guild.

32:55.559 --> 32:56.640
Look,

32:56.640 --> 32:59.079
we'll reply to the Tang family tomorrow.

32:59.079 --> 33:00.480
If we refuse again,

33:00.480 --> 33:01.559
Tang Silang will certainly

33:01.559 --> 33:03.519
make a scene at the flower guild.

33:03.519 --> 33:04.640
I'm afraid

33:04.640 --> 33:06.279
we have to take this order.

33:09.559 --> 33:10.792
Sir.

33:13.640 --> 33:16.480
Sir, Wang Qing,
the new owner of Huamanzhu, is here.

33:21.119 --> 33:22.839
Although Lady He is unyielding,

33:22.839 --> 33:24.039
she truly loves flowers.

33:24.559 --> 33:26.519
Wang Qing can't even plant flowers.

33:26.519 --> 33:27.519
Yet he used despicable means

33:27.519 --> 33:28.640
to take over Huamanzhu.

33:29.240 --> 33:30.839
The guild doesn't welcome such a shameless man.

33:30.839 --> 33:32.296
Kick him out.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.064
What?

33:37.720 --> 33:38.799
Did Wang Qing

33:38.799 --> 33:39.839
say anything?

33:41.039 --> 33:42.039
Wang Qing says

33:42.759 --> 33:44.279
he wants to take the Tang family's order.

33:53.119 --> 33:54.400
Why are you so late today?

33:54.400 --> 33:55.480
I treated two patients

33:55.480 --> 33:57.319
with abdominal pain.

33:57.319 --> 33:58.720
Any news from the flower guild?

33:58.720 --> 34:01.000
The flower guild gave that business deal
to Wang Qing.

34:01.000 --> 34:02.400
Really?

34:02.400 --> 34:03.680
Mudan guessed right.

34:05.400 --> 34:07.039
After inquiring for many days,

34:07.039 --> 34:08.599
I learned that nobody dares

34:08.599 --> 34:10.079
to host Madame Tang's birthday banquet.

34:10.079 --> 34:12.719
Wang Qing has never done business
with the noble.

34:12.719 --> 34:14.440
He only knows he can make a lot of money.

34:14.440 --> 34:15.559
Yet he doesn't know how hard it is

34:15.559 --> 34:16.880
to earn money from the rich.

34:16.880 --> 34:18.480
I just need to go with the flow

34:18.480 --> 34:19.880
and use a small trick

34:19.880 --> 34:21.719
to let him hear about this.

34:21.719 --> 34:23.440
With his greedy nature,

34:23.440 --> 34:24.559
how could he possibly miss it?

34:30.639 --> 34:31.920
How did it break again?

34:32.760 --> 34:34.679
The hoes I bought

34:34.679 --> 34:35.880
are not very good.

34:36.519 --> 34:38.199
Tomorrow, I will buy new ones.

34:38.199 --> 34:39.360
Take a rest.

34:39.360 --> 34:40.519
You've worked for so long.

34:40.519 --> 34:42.079
Have some tea.

34:42.079 --> 34:43.559
Come, Chun.

34:43.559 --> 34:44.840
Mudan.

34:44.840 --> 34:46.599
You designed such a big trap

34:46.599 --> 34:47.679
for Wang Qing

34:48.239 --> 34:49.960
not just to get Huamanzhu back

34:49.960 --> 34:51.119
from him, right?

34:51.719 --> 34:53.000
What do you mean?

34:54.280 --> 34:55.519
Sit.

34:55.519 --> 34:57.519
I've inquired a lot.

34:57.519 --> 34:59.760
Many businesses order flowers.

35:01.599 --> 35:04.440
But Mudan chose Madame Tang's order.

35:04.440 --> 35:05.760
You know

35:05.760 --> 35:07.519
Madame Tang is fastidious.

35:07.519 --> 35:08.719
You also know

35:08.719 --> 35:10.239
she's influential in the capital, right?

35:11.440 --> 35:12.719
Exactly.

35:12.719 --> 35:14.960
I established Huamanzhu.

35:14.960 --> 35:16.519
I will take it back

35:17.639 --> 35:19.119
and recover its reputation

35:19.119 --> 35:20.280
ruined

35:20.280 --> 35:21.400
by Wang Qing.

35:22.360 --> 35:25.159
You want to host Madame Tang's floral banquet.

35:25.159 --> 35:26.280
Since Tang Silang and Mr. Jiang

35:26.280 --> 35:27.360
are good friends,

35:27.360 --> 35:29.440
why don't you let Mr. Jiang pull some strings?

35:30.559 --> 35:32.400
The regular customers of Huamanzhu

35:32.400 --> 35:34.880
heard that I was saved by Jiang Changyang.

35:34.880 --> 35:35.880
In their eyes,

35:35.880 --> 35:37.119
I am no longer a shopkeeper

35:37.119 --> 35:38.519
but a maid.

35:38.519 --> 35:39.960
Moreover,

35:39.960 --> 35:41.159
I have neither a store

35:41.159 --> 35:42.760
nor sufficient floral materials.

35:42.760 --> 35:44.360
How could I possibly take on this deal?

35:45.000 --> 35:47.639
But Huamanzhu can.

36:04.904 --> 36:07.713
[Huamanzhu]

36:10.119 --> 36:11.320
Well,

36:11.320 --> 36:13.480
how come all the flowers have been sent back?

36:14.480 --> 36:16.760
We've paid a considerable deposit, right?

36:17.360 --> 36:18.840
How could you

36:18.840 --> 36:21.239
deliver these terrible flowers
for Madame Tang's birthday banquet?

36:23.000 --> 36:24.280
Before dawn,

36:24.280 --> 36:26.239
we picked flowers and loaded them.

36:26.880 --> 36:28.199
The Tang family's garden is outside the city.

36:28.199 --> 36:29.920
Enough of excuses.

36:29.920 --> 36:32.119
These flowers can't last a few hours.

36:32.119 --> 36:34.039
What will happen tomorrow?

36:35.000 --> 36:36.519
Deliver two carts of fresh flowers.

36:37.800 --> 36:39.519
They're all the flowers I can deliver.

36:42.840 --> 36:44.159
Please do me a favor.

36:44.679 --> 36:46.320
Go away.

36:46.320 --> 36:48.800
Whatever you do,

36:48.800 --> 36:49.960
tomorrow's birthday banquet

36:49.960 --> 36:51.199
must be successful.

36:51.880 --> 36:54.159
If the flowers are fewer or wilted,

36:54.159 --> 36:56.480
and you mess up the birthday banquet,

36:57.039 --> 36:58.639
you won't be paid

36:58.639 --> 37:00.239
or spared.

37:07.719 --> 37:10.159
Sir, the servants of the Tang family
are that fierce.

37:10.159 --> 37:11.360
If we mess up the birthday banquet

37:11.360 --> 37:12.400
and offend the nobility,

37:12.400 --> 37:14.079
I'm afraid we might lose our lives.

37:14.079 --> 37:16.000
Why don't we buy some fresh flowers?

37:17.840 --> 37:20.000
All the money was spent on these flowers.

37:20.519 --> 37:21.719
I have no extra money.

37:24.079 --> 37:25.280
What did the guild head say?

37:25.280 --> 37:27.000
The gatekeeper didn't let me in.

37:27.000 --> 37:28.480
According to the guild head,

37:29.039 --> 37:30.079
Huamanzhu

37:30.079 --> 37:31.679
isn't a guild-affiliated flower shop.

37:31.679 --> 37:33.360
The flower guild has mercifully

37:33.360 --> 37:34.960
sold many flowers to you.

37:34.960 --> 37:36.679
But you can't

37:36.679 --> 37:38.960
borrow floriculturists

37:38.960 --> 37:40.199
from the flower guild.

37:42.440 --> 37:43.688
What should we do?

37:51.519 --> 37:52.840
What are you doing?

37:52.840 --> 37:54.000
- Lady He.
- Shengyi.

37:54.000 --> 37:55.719
I was instigated by this evil woman.

37:55.719 --> 37:57.320
It was she who asked me to sue you.

37:57.320 --> 37:58.440
Now, I have brought her here.

37:58.440 --> 37:59.719
Do with her as you will.

37:59.719 --> 38:00.760
Shengyi, get up.

38:00.760 --> 38:03.480
Wang Qing failed
to deliver flowers to the noble.

38:03.480 --> 38:04.679
You shut up.

38:05.239 --> 38:06.440
Get out of here!

38:06.440 --> 38:07.679
Do not touch her.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.679
Shengyi, get up.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.840
Get up.

38:11.840 --> 38:13.128
Come on.

38:15.239 --> 38:16.760
Are you alright?

38:16.760 --> 38:18.039
I'll get a physician for you.

38:18.920 --> 38:20.039
No need.

38:20.039 --> 38:21.480
Don't dirty your clothes.

38:21.480 --> 38:23.559
She's already a broken woman.

38:23.559 --> 38:24.960
No one accepts her but me.

38:24.960 --> 38:26.039
She will only be with me.

38:26.599 --> 38:29.159
Lady He, there's no need to talk to her.

38:29.159 --> 38:30.599
Let's talk.

38:32.639 --> 38:33.800
I'm happy

38:35.039 --> 38:37.119
to talk to Shengyi.

38:42.039 --> 38:43.760
You shameless man,

38:44.639 --> 38:46.760
didn't you say
you would make me lose everything?

38:47.599 --> 38:49.119
What are you doing here?

38:49.119 --> 38:50.280
I don't want to talk to you.

38:50.280 --> 38:51.719
Get out!

38:51.719 --> 38:54.199
I made a mistake before.

38:55.000 --> 38:57.800
You're protected by the Floral Envoy.

38:57.800 --> 38:59.760
A lowly person like me
can't afford to offend you.

39:00.440 --> 39:01.440
I'm here

39:01.440 --> 39:02.840
because you and Wuniang

39:02.840 --> 39:04.280
are good friends.

39:05.360 --> 39:06.679
I know that after you return to Chang'an,

39:06.679 --> 39:08.000
you have no means of making a living.

39:08.000 --> 39:09.079
Coincidentally,

39:09.079 --> 39:10.679
I have taken on a birthday banquet.

39:11.239 --> 39:13.880
As long as you help me with that

39:13.880 --> 39:15.320
and get it done successfully,

39:15.320 --> 39:16.320
I'll sell Huamanzhu

39:17.679 --> 39:20.079
to you at this price.

39:21.039 --> 39:22.679
It is laughable.

39:22.679 --> 39:24.360
Huamanzhu was mine.

39:25.000 --> 39:26.360
You're doomed this time.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.800
You're begging for help.

39:27.800 --> 39:29.760
Yet you have the audacity
to sell my shop to me.

39:31.880 --> 39:33.440
How do you know?

39:33.440 --> 39:34.920
Generally, the birthday banquet for the noble

39:35.519 --> 39:37.239
is undertaken by the flower guild.

39:38.400 --> 39:40.400
Do you know

39:40.400 --> 39:41.599
why you

39:41.599 --> 39:43.320
got this business deal?

39:45.320 --> 39:47.679
Madam Tang is extremely picky,

39:47.679 --> 39:49.920
and Tang Silang is unscrupulous.

39:50.559 --> 39:51.599
The flower shops in the flower guild

39:51.599 --> 39:52.880
don't dare to take it on.

39:53.440 --> 39:54.719
Huamanzhu

39:54.719 --> 39:55.880
has not joined the flower guild.

39:56.400 --> 39:58.679
Even if you mess this up,

39:58.679 --> 40:00.719
it won't implicate them.

40:00.719 --> 40:02.000
For him,

40:03.199 --> 40:05.039
you're just a good scapegoat.

40:24.702 --> 40:30.976
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

40:32.830 --> 40:39.514
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

40:40.190 --> 40:47.388
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

40:48.382 --> 40:56.734
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

40:56.734 --> 41:04.277
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

41:04.931 --> 41:13.118
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

41:13.118 --> 41:20.929
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

41:21.534 --> 41:28.826
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

41:49.502 --> 41:56.385
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

41:57.686 --> 42:04.380
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

42:05.137 --> 42:12.439
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

42:13.123 --> 42:21.432
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

42:21.432 --> 42:28.863
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:29.694 --> 42:37.950
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:37.950 --> 42:45.374
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

42:46.378 --> 42:53.828
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
